{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52957","headline":"送贺秘监归会稽诗 · 于休烈","name":"送贺秘监归会稽诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飞名紫府内，抗手白云乡。\n道与松乔匹，荣辞园绮行。\n夫君既鹤驾，幼子复霓裳。\n少别留宸藻，东南归路光。\n（见《会稽掇英总集》卷二）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于休烈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52957.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52957","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}